OL,3,GNEWSACannabis farm worth #50,000
OL,4,Adismantled by police
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cannabis farm worth an estimated
OL,7,F#50,000 has been dismantled by police.
OL,9,FHertfordshire Police uncovered the
OL,10,Foperation in a house on Hartforde Road,
OL,11,FBorehamwood, on 4 November.
OL,13,FFive rooms in the property were being
OL,14,Fused to produce the drug, with the
OL,15,Fbuilding's windows modified to conceal
OL,16,Fthe activity inside.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
