OL,3,GNEWSACannabis farm worth #50,000
OL,4,Adismantled by police
OL,5,
OL,6,FInsp Paul Costello, from the
OL,7,FOperational Support Group, said:
OL,8,F"Cannabis factories present a
OL,9,Fsignificant danger to those living by
OL,10,Fthem as they can be a serious fire
OL,11,Fhazard."
